<BlogArticle
  title="Beta Videos, One Scan Away"
  description="Beta Video QR codes are now at Boulder Box. Scan a code beside a route to watch its video beta, then give the moves a try."
  date="2026-10-08"
>
  <p class="excerpt">Stuck on a move? Where you see a Beta Video QR code at Boulder Box, scan it to watch the route beta and see how the sequence goes.</p>

  <p>Some moves make more sense when you can see them. We’ve added Beta Video QR codes at the gym so you can check out a route’s video beta right there, then have a go yourself.</p>

  <h2>How to use it</h2>
  <p>Open your phone camera, point it at the QR code, and tap the link to watch the video. The code is labelled with the wall and route, so you can check you’re looking at the right problem.</p>
  <p>Not every route will have a video yet. Keep an eye out for the codes as more betas are added.</p>

  <h2>The QR stays the same</h2>
  <p>Routes change, and sometimes a video needs an update too. The QR code points to a saved route page, so our team can change the video behind it without replacing the code.</p>

  <p>Give it a scan next time you’re in. Then get back on the wall and see what works for you. Beta is a suggestion, after all.</p>
  <p>See you at Boulder Box.</p>
</BlogArticle>